      "body": "## Summary\n\n- add an eight-GPU MI355X launch recipe for MiMo-V2.6-Pro\n- select AITER for MoE and attention\n- explicitly enable `ROCM_QUICK_REDUCE_QUANTIZATION=INT4`\n- retain the validated TP8/EP8 DFLASH topology\n\n## Validation\n\nInternal ITT/MLflow validation on the complete MI355X DFLASH stack showed INT4 QuickReduce improving the two long-context anchors by 3.24% and 3.63%. The final composed stack improved the 12-point OOB throughput geomean by 5.57% and scored 0.7121 on GPQA.\n\nThis remains a draft because the complete recipe composes pending DFLASH graph metadata, P1, P4, and AITER changes; this PR tracks the deployment/config part independently.\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:white_check_mark: [Run #41031151851](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/41031151851)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #41031154124](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/41031154124)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:heavy_minus_sign: **No AMD PR run found for this commit**.<!-- slot:pr-test-amd:end -->\n<!-- pr-states:end -->",
